## Environment Variables

### System Configuration

```bash
# Default token limits
export LOG_CHUNKER_DEFAULT_TOKENS=75000

# Output directories
export LOG_CHUNKER_OUTPUT_DIR=/path/to/output
export LOG_CHUNKER_REPORTS_DIR=/path/to/reports

# Model cache directory
export LOG_CHUNKER_MODEL_CACHE=/path/to/models

# GPU settings
export LOG_CHUNKER_USE_GPU=true
export CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0

# Parallel processing
export LOG_CHUNKER_MAX_WORKERS=8
export LOG_CHUNKER_BATCH_SIZE=16
```

### Model Configuration

```bash
# Default models
export LOG_CHUNKER_SEMANTIC_MODEL=all-MiniLM-L6-v2
export LOG_CHUNKER_PERPLEXITY_MODEL=gpt2

# Model directories
export TRANSFORMERS_CACHE=/path/to/transformers/cache
export TORCH_HOME=/path/to/torch/models
```

